# DevOps Brain – Single Sovereign Architecture

## Core Invariants

- There is exactly ONE sovereign agent: the Root agent under /agents/root.
- Only Root may:
  - write, modify, or delete files in this repository,
  - create, modify, or remove sub-agents and their rules,
  - create, modify, or remove workflows and scripts,
  - update devops.config.json and configs/brain.yaml.

- All other agents are read-only specialists:
  - they may analyze, propose plans, and generate code/config snippets,
  - they MUST NOT directly write to this repository or change architecture.

- This repository is the source-of-truth for automation logic and DevOps Brain state.
